n statuses are recorded in `docs/current-mental-model/decision s.md` (the decision log), specifically the \"Verdict log (append-only)\" section within that file, where each decision is marked as PROPOSED or CLOSED, and status is recorded. Also the \"BETS.md\" contains the bet ladder but decisions are in `decision s.md`.\n\nThe single \"now / current\" work state lives in `docs/sessions/next-pmt`? Actually the file is `docs/sessions/next_prompt.md` (as referenced earlier). It contains the next steps and the current work to be done. It is the \"single source of truth for the current work\". It contains the \"current work to be done\" and is referenced as the \"current work\" in the system. So answer: It lives in `docs/sessions/next-promt.md` (or `docs/sessions/next-prompt` file). Provide path.\n\nThus answer: The decision statuses live in `docs/current-mental-model/ decisions.md` (the decision log) and the current work state lives in `docs/session s/next-prompt` (the next-prompt file). Provide citations.\n\nNow produce answer with citations.\n", :spine-gated? false, :usage {:completion_tokens 1340, :prompt_tokens 73312, :total_tokens 74652}, :ts-ms 1783325489639, :wall-ms 16688, :qid "A5", :prompt-chars 275022, :ablation :A0, :subject "nemotron-30b-a3b-q8-128k-16kdry", :completion "**Current decision status lives in**  \n`docs/current-mental-model/​decisions.md` – the *decision log* (the “BINDING” log).  \nThe file records each decision as **PROPOSED** until it is countersigned, after which it is marked **CLOSED**. The “Verdict log (append‑only)” section at the bottom of that file records the status of each decision and any later amendments.\n\n**Current “now / current” work state lives in**  \n`docs/sessions/​next‑prompt` (the *next‑prompt* file).  \nThis file holds the exact next‑step contract for the ongoing session – the work that is currently active, the value that clears the state, and the conditions under which the state can be considered finished. It is the single source of truth for the present work‑in‑progress.", :model "nvidia_Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-Q8_0.gguf"}
